      "message": "After checking how backend use them (d3d12: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/d3d12/CommandBufferD3D12.cpp;drc\u003d66bf64e67071911fffd159a4e3d556d055e76d85;l\u003d342), I think I could remove all \"setX/Y/Z alone\" API and cases 😊",
